From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:38:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 85/85] media: cedrus: copy buffer metadata with 7.2's two
 arguments

7.2's v4l2_m2m_buf_copy_metadata() drops the copy_frame_flags argument.
---
 drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_context.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_context.c b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_context.c
index 2f5d5d9..d2bf958 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_context.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_context.c
@@ -290,7 +290,7 @@ int cedrus_context_job_run(struct cedrus_context *ctx)
 
 	/* Copy buffer metadata (timestamp). */
 
-	v4l2_m2m_buf_copy_metadata(buffer_src, buffer_dst, true);
+	v4l2_m2m_buf_copy_metadata(buffer_src, buffer_dst);
 
 	/* Prepare engine job. */
 
-- 
2.47.3

